d a ring of giants plus  one down here the next two points are to  do with the rotten so number 9 the  rotten embraces all in the sanctuary for  all things unwanted or tossed away  comprised of hollows there's one in  particular who deserves special  attention the one on his left shoulder  this one dude mimics every action the  rotten makes or maybe he's the one  controlling the rotten mass and number  10 did you know that the rottens arms  can be cut off to reduce his lethality  cut off his right and he'll lose the  butcher's knife cut off his left and he  won't be able to do his smash or his  grab and he'll also drop a ferrous lock  stone the rotten has a few interesting  things going on with him in new game+ he  has the soul of an old dead one which  was nito's soul in Dark Souls 1 this is  a soul that aggregates things together  to become a whole also if you wait  outside his fog gate you can hear him  crying and as you arrive he's trying to  fix one of those statues and lastly the  idea of him dropping a ferrous lock  stone also raises a few more question  so if you want to hear about all the  stories of the things down the pit then  check out this video where I tell those  stories it's actually really interesting  so I hope you enjoy that and I'll catch  you guys next time Cheers

